{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16110032","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16110032","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1611003201:0":{"text":"大张旗鼓地使用变形术……你就这么喜欢在观众面前表演吗？","source_cn":"大张旗鼓地使用变形术……你就这么喜欢在观众面前表演吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1FA1D2DEB12BE98","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1611003202:0":{"text":"一旦他们想起变形术的限制规则，你立刻会暴露，你想让刚刚拉开的第一幕戏以悲剧收场吗？","source_cn":"一旦他们想起变形术的限制规则，你立刻会暴露，你想让刚刚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6924690C82B4B3B8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1611003203:0":{"text":"现在我混在这么多使用变形术的学生里，暂时很安全，但我会小心的。女士，你找我到底有什么事？","source_cn":"现在我混在这么多使用变形术的学生里，暂时很安全，但我会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE4B488EFB27824A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1611003204:0":{"text":"啊，我看出来了，你喜欢被舞台灯光照耀的感觉。你觉得自己是主角，所以可以为所欲为，是吗？","source_cn":"啊，我看出来了，你喜欢被舞台灯光照耀的感觉。你觉得自己...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB73484AFD0AC4605","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1611003205:0":{"text":"我能从深渊归来，给你带来新的礼物，当然也能将它从你手中收走。","source_cn":"我能从深渊归来，给你带来新的礼物，当然也能将它从你手中...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A92FED133AA5370","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","do